      "id": "8e44bdb8-0de1-5938-8ae9-f05f996c228a",
      "document_id": "tech/tpp-standards/v2.2-rc2/insurance/data-sharing",
      "type": "intro",
      "text": "Insurance Data Sharing\n\nThe Open Finance Insurance Data Sharing capabilities enable secure, consent-driven access to a customer’s insurance policy data across the UAE’s major sectors. These services empower licensed third-party providers (TPPs) to deliver policy aggregation, switching support, broking, claims assistance, and value-added digital insurance services.\n\nAll data access operates under explicit customer consent, with granular permission scopes, strict expiry controls, and full auditability.",
      "metadata": {
        "title": "Insurance Data Sharing",
        "source_repo": "Nebras-Open-Finance/community-standards",
