      "type": "section",
      "text": "Insurance Data Sharing > Insurance Service Provider\n\nAccess to the Insurance Data Sharing APIs requires the ISP role. This role must be assigned to your application in the Trust Framework before making any insurance policy requests. See Roles for the full list of scopes and grant types this role permits.",
